  'PwC Canada, BDO Canada, and CPA Ontario analysis of the CUSMA 2026 joint review, June to July 2026. McMillan LLP summary of the July 1, 2026 review outcome and Steel Derivative Goods Surtax Order extension. Global Affairs Canada trade commissioner tariff guidance on Section 232 sectoral tariffs. Congressional Research Service IN12519 on Section 232 steel, aluminum, and copper tariffs, 2026.'
);
